OL,3,GNEWSAJeweller left shaking after shop
OL,4,A'rammed by van'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA jeweller was left shaking from the
OL,7,Fdamage to her shop, after she said
OL,8,Fthieves repeatedly rammed her store
OL,9,Fwith a van during the middle of the
OL,10,Fnight.
OL,12,FShe said it happened at HC Jewellers in
OL,13,FBiggleswade, Bedfordshire, at about
OL,14,F01:20 BST on Friday, triggering alarms
OL,15,Fand filling the store with security
OL,16,Fsmoke.
OL,18,FCo-owner Hanna Suma said CCTV showed
OL,19,Fthe listed building being rammed three
OL,20,Ftimes before the attackers broke
OL,21,Fthrough. She said they fled before
OL,22,Fpolice arrived minutes later.
OL,23,APub: 10-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
