OL,3,GNEWSAJeweller left shaking after shop
OL,4,A'rammed by van'
OL,5,
OL,6,F"I was very upset and shaking and
OL,7,Fdidn't really know what to expect when
OL,8,Fwe came in," she told the BBC.
OL,9,FBedfordshire Police has been contacted
OL,10,Ffor comment.
